      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deadline propagation: 15050 -> 2045 ms of DB time. Lockstep retries: 25 of 100 callers succeed, full jitter: 100.\nOutage with a retry budget: 110 requests instead of 500. No key: alice pays twice; with a key bob pays once.\nBreaker: 9 of 40 calls reach a degraded payments instead of 40. Bulkhead: catalog answers in 2 ms, not 1457 ms.",
